        "description": "Evaluate a subscriber's thresholds against current forecasts.\n\nFree-tier dispatch: instead of an email service, subscribers (and the\nnightly job) read which thresholds are crossed right now. The identity\nkey is anonymous (device ID); a legacy email works the same way.",
        "operationId": "alert_check_v1_alerts_check_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "email",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
